      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "REV 18:20"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "with the judgment she imposed on you.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "The Finality of Babylon's Doom",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then a mighty angel picked up a boulder the size of a large millstone and threw it into the sea, and said:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "REV 18:21"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"With such violence",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "REV 18:21"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "the great city of Babylon will be thrown down,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "REV 18:21"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "never to be found again.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The music of harpists and musicians, pipers and trumpeters,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
